# Fiendish Panda: "When this creature dies, return another target non-Bear creature card with mana value less than or equal to this
# creature's power from your graveyard to the battlefield." The Panda gained a +1/+1 counter from Healing Salve on turn 1, so Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt on turn 4 kills a 4/3: its last-known power is 4, one more than printed, so Hill Giant (mana value 4) is a legal
# target. Grizzly Bears (a Bear), the Panda itself, Bot2's Memnite, Faithless Looting, a Mountain and Black Lotus are refused;
# Bot1's own Memnite is also legal, Hill Giant is chosen and enters under Bot1's control.

